6. INTERACTIVE PARTNER COMMISSION CALCULATOR
Create a sophisticated, real-time commission earnings calculator.

Headline:

See How Much You Could Earn With MsmeBooks

Description:

Estimate your potential recurring commission earnings based on the number of customers you refer, their subscription value, and your partnership level.

Calculator input controls:

Partner Level: Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum.

Monthly Subscription Value: Editable amount.

Number of Active Paying Customers: Slider or numeric input.

Billing Frequency: Monthly or Annual.

Calculation Period: Monthly, Quarterly, Annually.

Currency Selector: NGN, USD, GHS, KES, ZAR, and other supported currencies.

Optional Customer Growth Projection.

Commission calculation:

Monthly Commission = Eligible Monthly Subscription Revenue × Partner Commission Rate.

Annualized Commission = Monthly Commission × 12.

For annual subscriptions, calculate commissions according to the approved annual billing and payout policy, rather than assuming monthly payouts.

Example calculation:

Assume 50 active paying customers, each paying ₦10,000 monthly.

Partner Level	Monthly Commission	Annualized Commission
Bronze — 15%	₦75,000	₦900,000
Silver — 20%	₦100,000	₦1,200,000
Gold — 30%	₦150,000	₦1,800,000
Platinum — 40%	₦200,000	₦2,400,000
Display calculated results in premium SaaS analytics cards with lemon-green earnings figures and blue labels.

Include:

Animated earnings counter.

Monthly and annual revenue chart.

Side-by-side commission tier comparison.

Download Estimate as PDF.

Share Estimate.

Apply for Partnership CTA.

Mandatory disclaimer:

"Illustrative earnings only. Actual commissions depend on eligible paid subscriptions, applicable program terms, refunds, taxes, payment adjustments, and continued customer eligibility. Earnings are not guaranteed."

All currency conversions must use approved exchange-rate data, not arbitrary fixed rates.

